{"id":"lslocks.8","lang":"en","desc":"List local system locks.","items":[["List all local system locks","lslocks"],["List locks with defined column headers","lslocks {{[-o|--output]}} {{PID,COMMAND,PATH,...}}"],["List locks producing a raw output (no columns), and without column headers","lslocks {{[-r|--raw]}} {{[-n|--noheadings]}}"],["List locks by PID input","lslocks {{[-p|--pid]}} {{process_id}}"],["List locks with JSON output to `stdout`","lslocks {{[-J|--json]}}"]],"version":"v2.3","source":"https://github.com/tldr-pages/tldr/blob/main/pages/linux/lslocks.md"}